sequenceDiagram
    actor Owner as Cabin Owner
    participant App as Mobile App
    participant Server as Backend Server
    participant DB as Database
    participant Notif as Notification Service
    participant GW as Cabin Gateway
    participant TS as Temperature Sensor
    participant PM as Power Meter
    participant SS as Security Sensor

    Note over GW,SS: Periodic monitoring cycle
    loop Every measurement interval
        GW->>TS: Read temperature
        TS-->>GW: Temperature (°C)
        GW->>PM: Read energy consumption
        PM-->>GW: Consumption (kWh)
        GW->>SS: Read security status
        SS-->>GW: Door / motion status
        GW->>Server: Send sensor data
        Server->>DB: Store readings
        DB-->>Server: Ack
        alt Reading outside safe threshold
            Server->>Notif: Create alert
            Notif->>App: Push notification
            App-->>Owner: Show alert
        end
    end

    Note over Owner,Server: Owner checks status manually
    Owner->>App: Open app / request status
    App->>Server: Get latest status
    Server->>DB: Query latest readings
    DB-->>Server: Readings
    Server-->>App: Status data
    App-->>Owner: Display temperature, energy, security
